  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, since all avatars move at the same rate, if you have a tiny avatar, it will move on the ground really far but its legs will barely move. Also, if you have a giant avatar, its legs will move far too much compared to how much it's actually moving, like the avatar is doing the moon walk. It would be great if the walking animation was scaled so that the legs would move faster on small avatars and slower on giant avatars.",
